{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S03→S04：两段都在“想让对方知道自己有多喜欢、想更亲近—临到表达又收住”之间摆动。不过S04明确想起上次没说出口的事，并把表达欲推进到想说出全部心意，程度有所加深。\",\n    \"S08→S09→S10：刚对未来产生期待，又想到对方可能不再需要自己，于是从期待退回眼前，暂时不再猜测未来。\",\n    \"S11→S13→S14：刚下定决心即使对方不再需要自己也愿意陪伴，随后又担心这种喜欢得不到回应，甚至考虑少露心意。但S13的恐惧已经从怕给对方添负担转为怕失去对方的需要，S14也真正作出了不再隐藏的选择。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02→S04→S06：反复在想更靠近、大方表达，与怕太急、怕自己太贪心之间摆动。尤其S06，在对方已经看出他的在乎、相处也没有变冷淡之后，又重新出现想靠近与怕太贪心的拉扯，像回到了之前的心理状态。\",\n    \"S02→S04→S07：反复提前为眼前的亲近感到舍不得，急着想留住它。尤其S07，刚发现对方也需要自己的陪伴，本来获得了新的安全感，却又回到担心这一刻过去的情绪。\",\n    \"S08→S09→S11→S13：反复在相信两个人能长久、确认对方也需要自己，与害怕对方有一天不再需要自己之间摆动。S13再次出现想收回已经表达的喜欢的念头，核心恐惧与前面相近。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y更像在迷宫里来回，主要是S06重新演了一遍此前的靠近与退缩，S07又重复了对眼前亲近即将消逝的预先伤感。X也有相同的希望与恐惧交替，但心理变化更多带来新的认识和选择，尤其从害怕给对方添负担，发展到害怕失去对方的需要，最后主动接受不确定性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "863e3b28-eef8-4b6c-8ab9-eebda606127c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101642715593Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:17:36.676210+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "528c4f8331d7c6caa52e9812c2e353ec770408fe0f2ab4a02b9f9742e2356bc9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101642715593Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c0e7a4112d2c805e86c5190fb5b0a29d91cfc3b66526fd85f4868667747b759b"}}}
